# Paths the `tauri dev` file watcher must ignore to avoid self-triggered rebuild
# loops. Without this, the watcher sees writes under these paths and restarts the
# `terax` build — but the still-running dev app + its spawned sidecars hold open
# handles to the staged sidecar binaries, so `tauri-build`'s externalBin copy
# fails on Windows with "Access is denied" (os error 5).

# Sidecar crates are built out-of-band by their own scripts
# (scripts/build-otel-sidecar.mjs, scripts/build-localfs-sidecar.mjs), not by the
# main `tauri dev` rebuild. Watching their sources only causes spurious rebuilds.
otel-collector/
localfs/
kv-server/

# Staged externalBin sidecar binaries. `tauri-build` copies into this dir; the
# watcher seeing those writes would re-trigger the build that just wrote them.
binaries/

# Build output.
target/
gen/
